#: ../../source/docs/common-raw-imu-logging.rst:5
#: bf4d0670c9b24ab5a87b3c63b5c8edfb
msgid "Raw IMU Logging for FFT Analysis"
msgstr "用于 FFT 分析的原始 IMU 日志记录"

#: ../../source/docs/common-raw-imu-logging.rst:7
#: 489cb97200e24b199c630e3cdf745db6
msgid ""
"Using the :ref:`IMU Batch Sampler<common-imu-batchsampling>` to gather data "
"for spectral analysis of noise to setup notch filtering is the historical "
"method and still valid but with firmware 4.5 and later, and if using an "
"H7-based autopilot, a simpler and better method is to enable Raw IMU Logging"
" combined with the `Filter Review tool "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/FilterReview/>`__."
msgstr ""
"使用 :ref:`IMU 批量采样器<common-imu-batchsampling>` "
"收集数据进行频谱分析以设置陷波滤波器是传统方法，至今仍然有效。但固件 4.5 及更高版本中，若使用基于 H7 的飞控，有一种更简便且更好的方法：启用原始"
" IMU 日志记录并结合 `Filter Review 工具 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/FilterReview/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-raw-imu-logging.rst:9
#: 190757611b404cde92a4eacdeded2772
msgid ""
"The downside to this method is that it produces very large logs and unless "
"the data gathering is restricted to a single gyro, some slower autopilots "
"(F4-based, for example), may not be able to keep up resulting in logging "
"drop-outs. Also the data produced can only be analyzed by the `Filter Review"
" tool <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/FilterReview/>`__ on "
"the `ArduPilot Firmware \"Web Tools\" page "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/>`__."
msgstr ""
"此方法的缺点是会产生非常大的日志文件，且除非将数据采集限制为单个陀螺仪，某些较慢的飞控（例如基于 F4 "
"的型号）可能无法及时处理，导致日志丢包。此外，所产生的数据只能通过 `ArduPilot 固件「Web 工具」页面 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/>`__ 上的 `Filter Review 工具 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/FilterReview/>`__ 进行分析。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-raw-imu-logging.rst:11
#: 71d72de6d71b45ec8fcf61712914c1e1
msgid ""
"Using this new method greatly simplifies the notch filtering setup.  The "
"required data can be gathered in a single test flight and the filters can "
"then be setup interactively with the `Filter Review tool "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/FilterReview/>`__."
msgstr ""
"使用此新方法可大幅简化陷波滤波器的设置流程。所需数据可在单次测试飞行中采集，然后通过 `Filter Review 工具 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/FilterReview/>`__ 以交互方式配置滤波器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-raw-imu-logging.rst:14
#: f8deac3c4adc437c9f17ce7e106cefff
msgid "Filter Setup Process"
msgstr "滤波器设置流程"

#: ../../source/docs/common-raw-imu-logging.rst:16
#: bf385b4ed5be4451a7cd8d57f1292eef
msgid ""
"Select the method that will be used for dynamically adjusting the notch(s) "
"center frequency and do any required setup, ie if :ref:`ESC telemtry<common-"
"esc-telemetry>` will be used make sure its setup, if Throttle based make "
"sure your motor voltage compensation is setup (see ``Q_M_BATT_x`` params for"
" QuadPlane or ``MOT_BAT_x`` params for Copter)."
msgstr ""
"选择用于动态调整陷波频率的方法并完成所需设置：若使用 :ref:`ESC 数传<common-esc-telemetry>` "
"请确保已配置好；若基于油门，请确保电机电压补偿已设置（QuadPlane 参见 ``Q_M_BATT_x`` 参数，Copter 参见 "
"``MOT_BAT_x`` 参数）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-raw-imu-logging.rst:17
#: 5d386484efc6483c81d6df1392eee189
msgid ""
":ref:`INS_RAW_LOG_OPT<INS_RAW_LOG_OPT>`: any bits set will enable raw IMU "
"logging.  To prevent overloading the logging, especially on slower autopilot"
" CPUs, set :ref:`INS_RAW_LOG_OPT<INS_RAW_LOG_OPT>` bit 0 and bit 3 (value = "
"\"9\"). This will restrict logging to the primary gyro and log both pre and "
"post filtering."
msgstr ""
":ref:`INS_RAW_LOG_OPT<INS_RAW_LOG_OPT>`：任何位被置 1 均将启用原始 IMU "
"日志记录。为防止日志过载（尤其是在较慢的飞控 CPU 上），将 :ref:`INS_RAW_LOG_OPT<INS_RAW_LOG_OPT>` 的第 0"
" 位和第 3 位置 1（值为「9」）。这将把日志记录限制为主陀螺仪，并同时记录滤波前后的数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-raw-imu-logging.rst:18
#: 0e8fcf582bf2406f898e959e2f6ee59c
msgid ""
"Perform a regular flight (not just a gentle hover) of at least 30sec and "
":ref:`download the dataflash logs <common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-"
"logs-in-mission-planner>`."
msgstr ""
"执行一次正常飞行（不仅仅是轻柔悬停），飞行时间不少于 30 秒，然后 :ref:`下载数据日志 <common-downloading-and-"
"analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-raw-imu-logging.rst:19
#: 7eb6ac83a4554f0e9c43fbbeb135caaa
msgid ""
"Using the `Filter Review tool "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/FilterReview/>`__ load the "
"log. Select a steady hover portion of the log and press \"Calculate\". Then "
"you can enable one or both of the filters in the tool and experiment with "
"the parameters(refer back to the :ref:`common-imu-notch-filtering` page for "
"details of what each parameter means) to get the lowest noise in the "
"estimated post-filter spectrum, especially in the lower frequencies of the "
"control band (0-40Hz). Remember that each additional harmonic filter adds "
"cpu computational load. Usually only two or three per filter will be "
"sufficient."
msgstr ""
"使用 `Filter Review 工具 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/WebTools/FilterReview/>`__ "
"加载日志。选择日志中稳定悬停的部分，点击「Calculate」。然后可在工具中启用一个或两个滤波器，并调整参数（各参数含义详见 "
":ref:`common-imu-notch-filtering` "
"页面），使估计的滤波后频谱噪声尽量低，尤其是控制频带（0–40Hz）的低频部分。请注意，每添加一个谐波滤波器都会增加 CPU "
"计算负担，通常每个滤波器配置两到三个谐波即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-raw-imu-logging.rst:21
#: f1a67f30de9a4786aa00daf6b7287fc3
msgid ""
"if the FilterReview tool complains that not enough data is in the log, this "
"usually means that logging has not been able to keep up and has dropped some"
" packets. Either reduce the FFT window size to 512 from 1024, or, "
"preferably, try just clearing the pre and post logging option in "
":ref:`INS_RAW_LOG_OPT<INS_RAW_LOG_OPT>` and retry the test flight to log "
"only the input noise and use the estimated post-filter trace to setup the "
"filters."
msgstr ""
"若 FilterReview 工具提示日志中数据不足，通常意味着日志记录无法跟上并已丢弃部分数据包。可将 FFT 窗口大小从 1024 缩小至 "
"512，或者（优先建议）清除 :ref:`INS_RAW_LOG_OPT<INS_RAW_LOG_OPT>` "
"中的滤波前后日志选项后重新进行测试飞行，仅记录输入噪声并利用估计的滤波后曲线来设置滤波器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-raw-imu-logging.rst:23
#: 0daa7466337c4853b8be3ed80e167f2a
msgid "Save those parameters and load them into the autopilot."
msgstr "保存这些参数并加载至飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-raw-imu-logging.rst:24
#: 33504de429d54b8ea053a1af244da423
msgid ""
"Do another flight to confirm the filter setup. This this flight more normal "
"flight maneuvers can be done."
msgstr "再进行一次飞行以确认滤波器设置。此次飞行可执行更多正常飞行机动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-raw-imu-logging.rst:25
#: 25f4fd2a4e8c4e1a8b7136450413f497
msgid ""
"Once verified, clear the :ref:`INS_RAW_LOG_OPT<INS_RAW_LOG_OPT>` parameter "
"to avoid large logs from being saved unnecessarily."
msgstr "确认无误后，清除 :ref:`INS_RAW_LOG_OPT<INS_RAW_LOG_OPT>` 参数，以避免不必要地保存大型日志文件。"
